comments.body:
@participant6 thanks for running this experiment. So compose v2.26 with opentelemetry enabled don't produce this memory leak. The other difference can be otel version bump, and maybe introduction of [otel/metrics dependency](https://github.com/docker/compose/compare/v2.26.1...v2.29.7#diff-33ef32bf6c23acb95f5902d7097b7a1d5128ca061167ec0716715b0b9eeaa5f6R49) as suggested by https://github.com/moby/moby/issues/48144#issuecomment-2390659200

Proposed fix https://github.com/docker/compose/pull/12188
Would you be able to test docker-compose [binary from this PR](https://github.com/docker/compose/actions/runs/11212223969) (bottom) and check the impact ?
